# DrumMania (GQ881 VER. JAD): the first power-on, from the set's own flash and timekeeper (MAME's
# set has them filled). "DRUM MANIA INSTALLER, PLEASE PRESS THE TEST BUTTON" (by frame ~180); Test
# writes the flash ("WRITING COMPLETED, PLEASE PRESS THE TEST BUTTON" by frame ~10200). Hashes the
# main RAM every frame and snapshots every 60 frames, to compare with MAME.
game drmn

hash ram  0x80000000 0x80400000   # 4 MiB main RAM (KSEG0)

at 600 press "Service Mode" 8
from 0 every 60 snap
at 11000 quit
